ack review process    enabling both expedited expert review for low-risk projects and full committee evaluation for complex proposals       Decision tree workflow    to ensure consistent, transparent evaluation while protecting student-athlete welfare        The framework reflects our commitment to building Baylor's distinctive research identity while prioritizing athlete welfare and maintaining operational feasibility. We've also maintained productive research momentum. Dr. Gallucci's team published 6 papers, delivered 4 conference presentations, and submitted 1 grant application in 2025.         Immediate Next Steps:           We're ready to pilot our new framework with an incoming HHPR doctoral student proposal. This will allow us to test the evaluation process, refine our workflows, and validate the documentation before broader implementation.   
