ust not be removed from the facility.      Personnel should wear appropriate attire.        Family, friends, other University staff, etc. are not permitted to use the facility.  This use is for Athletics Department staff only.       Due to more variable team training schedules and limited space, this access only applies to the Simpson weight room.        It is encouraged for you to introduce yourself to the Athletics Performance staff prior to using the facility.          Not following these rules will lead to limiting or revoking and individual’s weight room facility access.              Schedule:                The Simpson Athletics and Academic Center Weight Room will open for staff use around 9:00 a.m., once team training is finished in the mornings.      The Simpson weight room will be generally open for staff use from around 9:00 a.m. – 3:00 p.
